<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH PX50 INDEX CLOSES DOWN 0.7 PTS AT 518.1.</title>
<headline>CZECH PX50 INDEX CLOSES DOWN 0.7 PTS AT 518.1.</headline>
<text>
<p>1500 GMT - The Prague Stock Exchange's PX50 index closed on Tuesday down 0.7 points, or 0.13 percent, at 518.1.</p>
<p>*Overall, 155 stocks rose, 151 lost ground and 67 were unchanged.</p>
<p>*Total volume 809,024 shares on turnover of 692.8 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
